WEBVTT

NOTE Hog Wild (1930) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500
[music]

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:07.180
Look for it.

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:17.170
You wives?

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.020
I don't think so. We husbands

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:22.140
can't even find the telephone.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:25.900
Find that hat

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.370
thing. I tend

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:49.710
there stuttering.

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:52.760
Have you seen my hat? Of
course she's seen your hat.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.760
You may leave it for me.

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:04.880
There you are.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:09.620
How do you expect me to uphold
the dignity of my home when you

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:11.410
belittle me in front
of the servants?

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:12.830
It

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:14.180
has gone far enough.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.560
If I don't find that hat,
I'm leaving this house.

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.780
Never to talk in
its doors again.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:49.650
I don't find it.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.640
Have a cab.

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:09.990
Yes.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.140
An appointment with Stanley.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.200
What about our radio? Well,

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:29.610
what about it? It hasn't
worked in three months.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:31.850
Just because you've been too...

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.020
too indisposed to
put up an aerial.

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:39.690
I'll put it up tomorrow. You'll
put it up today, right now.

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:21.920
You're

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.140
going to meet me.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.410
Honey wants to get Japan.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.420
Gee, I'd like to hear Japan too.

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:05.800
Do you mind if I help you?

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:08.590
I don't mind.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:11.740
That is, if you'll help me.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.070
Back your car in.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.210
to

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:55.800
go down for a thing,

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.520
hold on that end.

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:02.280
What for?

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:11.780
Playing.

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:22.260
Better go in the house and
I'll pass the wire down to you.
